import{i as e}from"./index-Bv1y5XyQ.js";import{t}from"./TributeRoom-BMVyzKZS.js";var n=e(),r=()=>(0,n.jsx)(t,{room:{eyebrow:`Twenty bright reasons`,title:`Twenty things I love`,intro:`A proper twenty reasons, because a girl this special deserves more than a few quick words.`,lines:[`1. I love the way your smile arrives before you even say a word. It has that rare kind of warmth that makes a room feel lighter, and it reminds everyone around you that joy can be simple and completely real.`,`2. I love that you are gorgeous in the full sense of the word: not only in the way you look, but in the way you carry yourself, care for people and turn ordinary moments into something beautiful.`,`3. I love the big-sister place you hold in my heart. You have become someone I can admire, laugh with and hold close, and that is a gift I will never treat as small.`,`4. I love your awesome spirit. You bring your own energy into a room, and it is impossible to mistake that spark for anyone else's.`,`5. I love your laugh because it makes happy moments feel even happier. I hope your twentieth year gives you so many reasons to laugh that you lose count.`,`6. I love that you deserve to be celebrated loudly. Not because it is your birthday alone, but because your presence has always been worth making a little noise about.`,`7. I love the way you make beauty feel natural. You do not need to force it; it is in the way you show up, the way you smile and the way you stay yourself.`,`8. I love your heart and the softness you bring to the people who know you well. That tenderness is strength, and I hope no one ever convinces you otherwise.`,`9. I love that twenty looks good on you already. This is not just a number; it is the beginning of a decade with more freedom, more discovery and more chances to build the life you want.`,`10. I love your ability to be memorable without trying too hard. Some people simply leave a beautiful impression, and you are one of those people.`,`11. I love the confidence I see growing in you. Keep choosing yourself, speaking up for yourself and walking into every room knowing that you belong there.`,`12. I love that you can be both lovely and strong. You do not have to choose one version of yourself when you were made with room for both.`,`13. I love the memories we already have, even the small ones. They are proof that a close heart is built through time, laughter and showing up again and again.`,`14. I love how much possibility is waiting for you. Your story is still opening, and I hope every next page surprises you in the gentlest, brightest ways.`,`15. I love your style of being you. It is yours alone, and the world is better because you do not need to copy anyone else to shine.`,`16. I love that you give people something to admire. The people who know you get to see how special you are beyond any photograph or birthday caption.`,`17. I love your future because it belongs to you. I hope you choose dreams that stretch you, people who honour you and places that make you feel alive.`,`18. I love the calm strength behind your beauty. You have more depth than a first glance can ever show, and I hope you always get the time and space to be fully known.`,`19. I love that you are close to my heart. Distance, busy days and new chapters cannot take away the care I have for you.`,`20. Most of all, I love that you are Laleti. There is no replacement for your light, your heart or your place in the lives of people who love you. Happy twentieth birthday, beautiful.`],next:`/hero`,nextLabel:`Next: what makes you special`}});export{r as component};